# -*- encoding: utf-8 -*-
# Arc: WarArc | Scene: TheBattleForTheCapital

translate it strings:

    old "Speak privately with Varga."
    new "Parla privatamente con Varga."

    old "Let's keep drinking. I have some wine in my room."
    new "Continuiamo a bere. Ho del vino nella mia stanza."

    old "You don't want it to pass; press on."
    new "Non vuoi che passi; premi avanti."

    old "Let cooler heads prevail; send Varga away."
    new "Fai prevalere la calma e manda via Varga."

    old "I think that's enough for me for tonight."
    new "Credo che sia abbastanza per stasera."

    old "Speak privately with Marion"
    new "Parla in privato con Marion"

    old "I'll take your proposal into consideration."
    new "Considererò la tua proposta."

    old "This proposal is absurd."
    new "Questa proposta è assurda."

    old "Go back to bed."
    new "Torna al letto."

    old "Sarah can't do it, she drops the dagger."
    new "Sarah non ce la fa e lascia cadere il pugnale."

    old "Sarah plunges the dagger into her heart."
    new "Sarah conficca il pugnale nel cuore."
